<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ M-3 money supply fell 0.9 pct in November.</title>
<headline>NZ M-3 money supply fell 0.9 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand on Wednesday released the following estimated money supply figures for November:</p>
<p>    M3		   Nov 1996	 Oct 1996	  Nov 1995</p>
<p>    mthly change     -0.9 pct	  2.4 pct	   1.1 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change  12.8 pct	 15.1 pct	  12.6 pct</p>
<p>    PSC		  Nov 1996	 Oct 1996	  Nov 1995</p>
<p>    mthly change     -0.3 pct	  0.8 pct	   2.1 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change  11.3 pct	 14.0 pct	  12.0 pct</p>
<p>    M1		   Nov 1996	 Oct 1996	  Nov 1995</p>
<p>    mthly change     -1.5 pct	  1.8 pct	   0.9 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change  -1.3 pct	  1.1 pct	   0.8 pct</p>
<p>-- Welington Newsroom 64 4 4714 273</p>
</text>
